    (flag_block_state acquired waiter flags old_task delay)) by exact Havailable.
  assert (Hold : inUsedTaskStates (TskState acquired) (flagTask waiter) = Some old_task)
    by (unfold flag_block_call_protocol in Hprotocol; tauto).
