    flag_pend_caller_masked_control, flag_pend_masked_control.
  Intros.
  unfold released.
  rewrite (flag_pend_ready_flags_capsules_eq__immediate_clear_4 environment acquired_local
    acquired current_tid current_task ready Hold).
